## 4. 编译与安装

### 4.1 环境要求

- g++ (C++17)
- CMake 3.10+
- libnuma
- Linux 内核 5.14+ (UINTR 支持)

### 4.2 编译

```bash
cd ~/YCSB-YW/sharedkv/native
./scripts/build.sh

# 验证
ls benchmark/build/sharedkv_benchmark
```

